1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,321
I always sat in the back seat growing
up.

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,751
Watching my older siblings take the
wheel.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,201
Then came the day I sat in the driver's
seat.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,491
My hands gripped the wheel so tight.

5
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,981
Checking the mirror over and over.

6
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,951
Now my phone lights up, day or night.

7
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,601
I drive my sisters home at night.

8
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:50,931
By day, I take my parents on their
errands.

9
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:57,191
The little ones sit on my lap and hold
the wheel.

10
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,131
The quiet kid from the back seat...

11
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:10,281
...is the one who brings everyone home.
